{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The mission is simple: reach your destination using only words!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A pilot and a navigator must work together to fly the plane. The pilot watches the screen and controls the aircraft, while the navigator reads a physical map. Since neither can see the other\u2019s information, only sharp communication will get you there!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use every sight and sound as your guide!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> From the cockpit, the pilot can spot mountains, lakes, and other landmarks to navigate. Entering certain airspaces triggers unique sounds as audio clues. With each player seeing different information and clues, clear communication is key to a successful flight. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/c9a5e0e8a66f00be0331b7aba47eaa00.poster.avif?t=1753325606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/c9a5e0e8a66f00be0331b7aba47eaa00.webm?t=1753325606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/c9a5e0e8a66f00be0331b7aba47eaa00.mp4?t=1753325606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Replays let you relive the flight!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Celebrate success. Or laugh at moments like \u201cWait, that\u2019s what you heard!?\u201d and those unexpected detours.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/320bb7944a837743f4220f7dff9cc1a0.poster.avif?t=1753325606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/320bb7944a837743f4220f7dff9cc1a0.webm?t=1753325606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/320bb7944a837743f4220f7dff9cc1a0.mp4?t=1753325606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Boost immersion with a paper map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Print out the custom map, mix and match the pieces, and explore fresh terrain every time. The mix of paper and digital creates a unique, hands-on play experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/4eee6663442d01fcd9b3a3715546cd3a.poster.avif?t=1753325606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/4eee6663442d01fcd9b3a3715546cd3a.webm?t=1753325606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/4eee6663442d01fcd9b3a3715546cd3a.mp4?t=1753325606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play anywhere with your own conversation style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over the Radio is designed for local play, but with voice chat or a call app, you can enjoy it even when you're far apart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*The navigator just needs the map; only the pilot runs the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*Replays are pilot-only, but you can share the screen via a call app to watch together.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3790280?t=1753325606","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/5d364bf37d3794eda91071a78e7e74156d826eaa/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1753325606","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/fbd53d9e22fee135bd8a743c1bd93db3005d5961/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1753325606","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/fbd53d9e22fee135bd8a743c1bd93db3005d5961/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1753325606","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>The mission is simple: reach your destination using only words!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A pilot and a navigator must work together to fly the plane. The pilot watches the screen and controls the aircraft, while the navigator reads a physical map. Since neither can see the other\u2019s information, only sharp communication will get you there!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Use every sight and sound as your guide!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> From the cockpit, the pilot can spot mountains, lakes, and other landmarks to navigate. Entering certain airspaces triggers unique sounds as audio clues. With each player seeing different information and clues, clear communication is key to a successful flight. <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/c9a5e0e8a66f00be0331b7aba47eaa00.poster.avif?t=1753325606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/c9a5e0e8a66f00be0331b7aba47eaa00.webm?t=1753325606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/c9a5e0e8a66f00be0331b7aba47eaa00.mp4?t=1753325606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Replays let you relive the flight!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Celebrate success. Or laugh at moments like \u201cWait, that\u2019s what you heard!?\u201d and those unexpected detours.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/320bb7944a837743f4220f7dff9cc1a0.poster.avif?t=1753325606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/320bb7944a837743f4220f7dff9cc1a0.webm?t=1753325606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/320bb7944a837743f4220f7dff9cc1a0.mp4?t=1753325606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Boost immersion with a paper map</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Print out the custom map, mix and match the pieces, and explore fresh terrain every time. The mix of paper and digital creates a unique, hands-on play experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/4eee6663442d01fcd9b3a3715546cd3a.poster.avif?t=1753325606\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/4eee6663442d01fcd9b3a3715546cd3a.webm?t=1753325606\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/extras/4eee6663442d01fcd9b3a3715546cd3a.mp4?t=1753325606\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Play anywhere with your own conversation style</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Over the Radio is designed for local play, but with voice chat or a call app, you can enjoy it even when you're far apart. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*The navigator just needs the map; only the pilot runs the game.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>*Replays are pilot-only, but you can share the screen via a call app to watch together.</i></p>","developers":["Polygoose Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/e64cbd15c95bad0b0888ab0d4c1fe8149328676a/header.jpg?t=1753325606","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"name":"Over the Radio","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 +<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-8100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 1050<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Polygoose Studio"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"l","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"","rating":"0","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"0","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"2026"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/16b5774b9623d7876147fb83b54db6dc0bc86ab2/ss_16b5774b9623d7876147fb83b54db6dc0bc86ab2.1920x1080.jpg?t=1753325606","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/16b5774b9623d7876147fb83b54db6dc0bc86ab2/ss_16b5774b9623d7876147fb83b54db6dc0bc86ab2.600x338.jpg?t=1753325606"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/a6dccb556873de99f4056e972af5a95bfb79c9f3/ss_a6dccb556873de99f4056e972af5a95bfb79c9f3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1753325606","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/a6dccb556873de99f4056e972af5a95bfb79c9f3/ss_a6dccb556873de99f4056e972af5a95bfb79c9f3.600x338.jpg?t=1753325606"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/3d990d37cc4ca761ed341511e0dd9338a12f63f0/ss_3d990d37cc4ca761ed341511e0dd9338a12f63f0.1920x1080.jpg?t=1753325606","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/3d990d37cc4ca761ed341511e0dd9338a12f63f0/ss_3d990d37cc4ca761ed341511e0dd9338a12f63f0.600x338.jpg?t=1753325606"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/9fe394d9c635ca5416f59deeb9d212533148b1ca/ss_9fe394d9c635ca5416f59deeb9d212533148b1ca.1920x1080.jpg?t=1753325606","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/9fe394d9c635ca5416f59deeb9d212533148b1ca/ss_9fe394d9c635ca5416f59deeb9d212533148b1ca.600x338.jpg?t=1753325606"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/9410ee25970733838743f0bd5a7476eda5202653/ss_9410ee25970733838743f0bd5a7476eda5202653.1920x1080.jpg?t=1753325606","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3790280/9410ee25970733838743f0bd5a7476eda5202653/ss_9410ee25970733838743f0bd5a7476eda5202653.600x338.jpg?t=1753325606"}],"short_description":"Local co-op game about flying a plane. One player is the pilot, the other the navigator. The pilot has no map. The navigator guides the pilot using only words. Work together to reach your goal in a remixable national park map.","steam_appid":3790280,"support_info":{"email":"support-overtheradio@polygoose.studio","url":""},"supported_languages":"English, Japanese","type":"game","website":"https://overtheradio.polygoose.studio/"}